<urn:kg:chapter1:property:fc3812ef5332507af1399bcd> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "层流边界层在弹丸后方转化为湍流边界层"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:sourceSampleIds> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Assumption> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Assumption> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源结构假设"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Assumption> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Claim> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Assumption> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "来源分析对结构角色与数量作出的假设命题；假设的保存不等于该结构普遍存在。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Assumption> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Behavior> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Behavior> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源模型行为"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Behavior> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Subject> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Behavior> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "在来源语境下讨论的模型行为描述；模型趋近不等于实际对象无条件属于该模型。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Behavior> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Capacity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Capacity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源承载能力命题"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Capacity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Claim> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Capacity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "来源对对象能否承受某类负载及程度的描述，保留 can、little or no 和负载组合。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Capacity> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Claim> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Claim> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源限定命题"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Claim> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "来源中具有内容、极性、归属和适用范围的命题描述；保存命题不表示系统批准该命题。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Claim> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Classification> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Classification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源分类判据"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Classification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Claim> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Classification> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "描述来源中的分类、模型归类或命名判据及其条件和量词；不自动作为全称类公理。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Classification> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Comparison> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Comparison> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源比较命题"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Comparison> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Claim> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Comparison> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "来源对多个变化量共同给出的比较命题，保留 more/higher 的作用域；不自动拆成独立全称因果。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Comparison> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Concept> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Concept> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源限定概念"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Concept> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "在给定来源中被明确指称的概念描述；保留来源身份和局部含义，不从词面推导跨来源等价。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Concept> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ConceptGroup> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ConceptGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源概念组"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ConceptGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Concept> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ConceptGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "由来源作为组合讨论的概念描述组；组的陈述不自动分配给每个成员。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ConceptGroup> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Condition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Condition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源条件命题"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Condition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Claim> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Condition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "来源明确给出的适用条件描述；合取、析取和附着对象须保留。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Condition> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Context> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Context> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源分析情境"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Context> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "来源明确限定的分析、建模或推导情境；不表示其假设适用于所有物理系统。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Context> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ContinuityEquation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ContinuityEquation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "连续方程（质量守恒）"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ContinuityEquation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Equation> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ContinuityEquation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "continuity equation"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ContinuityEquation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "equation of conservation of mass"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ContinuityEquation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "质量守恒方程"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ContinuityEquation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "连续方程"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ContinuityEquation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "本轮来源将质量守恒方程同称为 continuity equation；此类表示该质量守恒方程概念，不泛指任意守恒方程或其全部具体形式。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ContinuityEquation> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ControlBoundary> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ControlBoundary> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源控制体边界对象"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ControlBoundary> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Subject> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ControlBoundary> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "给定来源指定的控制体边界或端面的对象描述；不同情境中的边界不自动同一。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ControlBoundary> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ControlSurfaceRole> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ControlSurfaceRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源控制面角色"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ControlSurfaceRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Concept> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ControlSurfaceRole> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "来源赋给某控制体边界对象的控制面角色描述；角色指定不等于所有边界对象的普遍分类。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ControlSurfaceRole> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ControlVolume> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ControlVolume> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源控制体对象"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ControlVolume> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Subject> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ControlVolume> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "来源分析选择的控制体描述，保留真实或假想的说明及分析范围。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ControlVolume> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Density> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Density> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源密度约束命题"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Density> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Claim> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Density> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "来源对密度的空间比较和时间变化的条件性约束描述；定性常数不是已知数值。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Density> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Derivation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Derivation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源推导描述"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Derivation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Event> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Derivation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "来源描述的推导或确定过程，区分输入、操作、结果与适用范围；不自动补齐省略的输入或执行计算。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Derivation> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:DerivationResult> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:DerivationResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源推导结果项"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:DerivationResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Concept> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:DerivationResult> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "作为给定推导之结果的方程或物理量描述；类型不意味着该结果已由本系统证明。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:DerivationResult> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Equation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Equation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源方程描述"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Equation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Concept> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Equation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "在来源中有明确身份的方程或方程表述描述；同号但不同文档的方程不自动同一。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Equation> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Event> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Event> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源事件描述"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Event> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Claim> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Event> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "来源所述事件、过程或可能事件的描述，分别保存参与角色、方式、程度、尺度和语气；不自动断言事件已发生。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Event> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:FlowContext> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:FlowContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源流动情境"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:FlowContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Context> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:FlowContext> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "来源中带流体对象和条件的流动情境描述。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:FlowContext> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:FluidGroup> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:FluidGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源流体对象组"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:FluidGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Subject> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:FluidGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "来源限定的流体对象或子集描述，保留 Many 等量词，不能自动提升为所有流体。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:FluidGroup> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Function> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Function> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源函数关系"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Function> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Concept> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Function> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "给定来源中用于关联变量或描述状态的函数关系描述；函数关联不自动构成物理因果。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Function> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Intensity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Intensity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源强度概念"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Intensity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Concept> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Intensity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "来源在特定现象语境下所称强度的概念描述；其表征量须由来源说明。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Intensity> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Interpretation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Interpretation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源归属解释"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Interpretation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Claim> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Interpretation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "具有作者解释口吻、引用归属或局部表征范围的解释命题；不自动成为对象的无条件本质属性。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Interpretation> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Law> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Law> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源物理定律概念"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Law> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Concept> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Law> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "给定来源所称物理定律及其陈述身份的概念描述；与该定律的具体表述命题和应用范围分开。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Law> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:MaterialContext> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:MaterialContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源物质条件"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:MaterialContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Context> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:MaterialContext> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "函数关系或状态描述所针对的物质及其限定情境；不与函数关系本身混同。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:MaterialContext> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Notation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Notation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源记号惯例"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Notation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Concept> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Notation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "来源所讨论的数学或物理记号使用惯例描述；与作者本次实际书写或忽略惯例的做法分开。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Notation> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Passage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Passage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源篇章片段"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Passage> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "具有文档版本和精确跨度的篇章位置描述；篇章先后位置不是物理时间。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Passage> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Premise> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Premise> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源推导前提"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Premise> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Claim> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Premise> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "给定推导以之为前提的命题描述；不是对所有对象的无条件属性断言。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Premise> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Principle> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Principle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源状态公设概念"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Principle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Concept> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Principle> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "给定来源所指状态公设的概念描述，保留其所讨论系统的范围。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Principle> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:PropertyCount> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:PropertyCount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源独立性质数目概念"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:PropertyCount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Concept> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:PropertyCount> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "给定状态描述所需独立性质数目的概念描述；数目与决定该数目的原理分开。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:PropertyCount> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Quantity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Quantity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源结果量描述"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Quantity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Concept> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Quantity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "在来源中作为结果或被解释对象讨论的物理量描述；与其值、成因及表征方式分开。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Quantity> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Ratio> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Ratio> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源物理量比值"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Ratio> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Concept> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Ratio> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "来源中具有所比物理量和局部用途的量比值概念描述；比值不等于任一个被比的量。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Ratio> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Requirement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Requirement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源要求命题"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Requirement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Claim> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Requirement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "来源提出的分析或记号使用要求，保留规范性语气、理由及作者实际采用或忽略的说明。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Requirement> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:StateEquation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:StateEquation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "一般物质状态方程"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:StateEquation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:4bc8bec4b08bd444266944eb> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:StateEquation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <urn:kg:chapter1:class:ccf0f583bf2af5da81d0767c> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:StateEquation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Function> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:StateEquation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "equation of state"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:StateEquation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "通用物质状态方程"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:StateEquation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "本轮来源将描述物质状态变量之间、随物质而异的函数关系称为 equation of state；此类表达该通用概念，不合并旧本体中两个气象应用描述节点。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:StateEquation> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Subject> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Subject> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源限定对象"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Subject> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "给定来源明确指称的对象或受限对象集合的描述；不据本类成员身份断言对象实际存在或断言集合为全体。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Subject> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Symbol> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Symbol> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源算子符号"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Symbol> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Concept> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Symbol> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "来源中被说明的数学算子符号描述；符号与其表达式转写及排版证明分开。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Symbol> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:SystemContext> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:SystemContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源系统情境"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:SystemContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Context> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:SystemContext> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "来源中具有质量、过程等明确限定的系统情境描述；不自动声明该过程已经发生。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:SystemContext> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Term> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Term> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源方程项"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Term> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Concept> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Term> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "在特定来源方程中有位置或角色身份的项描述；不同方程的同序项不自动同一。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Term> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:UnitSpec> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:UnitSpec> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源单位说明"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:UnitSpec> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Concept> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:UnitSpec> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "给定来源对量的单位或量纲表达的说明；不等于一次测量的数值。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:UnitSpec> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Unspecified> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Unspecified> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源未指定内容命题"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Unspecified> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Claim> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Unspecified> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "来源明确说明某方程或表述没有指定的内容；这种否定不表示所述物理量不存在。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Unspecified> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Variables> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Variables> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来源变量组"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Variables> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Concept> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Variables> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "在给定函数关系中共同讨论的变量描述组；保留已知与未知、部分量词及参与角色。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Variables> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:modelingOrigin> "source_scoped_engineering_definition_pending_semantic_review" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:characterizesInContext> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:characterizesInContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Ratio> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:characterizesInContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "characterizesInContext"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:characterizesInContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Intensity> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:characterizesInContext> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "量与所表征强度的局部约定：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“量比值”记录到“强度概念”的量与所表征强度的局部约定。压力比作为该段激波强度的表征；不建压力与强度的无条件 owl:sameAs 或类等价。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:characterizesInContext> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:characterizesInContext> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:sourceSampleIds> "PILOT-012" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:doesNotSpecifyInContext> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
