<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:doesNotSpecifyInContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "doesNotSpecifyInContext"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:doesNotSpecifyInContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Unspecified> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:doesNotSpecifyInContext> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "方程项含义及方程未表达内容：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“有来源身份的方程”记录到“未指定内容命题”的方程项含义及方程未表达内容。精确绑定方程号/项；否定指定内容不是否定该物理量存在，material 不自行改写为累计质量。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:doesNotSpecifyInContext> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
