<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:expressesLaw> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Equation> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:expressesLaw> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "expressesLaw"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:expressesLaw> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Law> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:expressesLaw> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "有输入和范围的推导/表达关系：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“方程描述”记录到“定律概念”的有输入和范围的推导/表达关系。推导节点分别记录输入、操作、输出、适用范围；不把一输入描述升级为唯一输入，不倒转结果与操作。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:expressesLaw> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
