<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasApplicationScope> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasApplicationScope> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Law> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasApplicationScope> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hasApplicationScope"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasApplicationScope> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:SystemContext> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasApplicationScope> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "定律的系统范围：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“定律表述”记录到“系统情境”的定律的系统范围。固定质量和经历过程限定到同一系统；不是系统必然发生该过程的事件事实。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasApplicationScope> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasApplicationScope> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:sourceSampleIds> "PILOT-029" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasApproachCondition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasApproachCondition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Behavior> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasApproachCondition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hasApproachCondition"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasApproachCondition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Condition> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasApproachCondition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "理想行为的趋近条件：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“模型行为”记录到“条件命题”的理想行为的趋近条件。保留 approached 的程度与条件，不改成等价、无条件分类或气体组成断言。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasApproachCondition> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasApproachCondition> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:sourceSampleIds> "PILOT-005" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasAttributedCharacterization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasAttributedCharacterization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Concept> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasAttributedCharacterization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hasAttributedCharacterization"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasAttributedCharacterization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Interpretation> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasAttributedCharacterization> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "带归属的局部解释：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“概念”记录到“来源解释命题”的带归属的局部解释。解释命题节点记录作者/引述、肯定或否定、Think of it as 与原始跨度；不升级为恒常本质属性。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasAttributedCharacterization> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
