<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasCauseInContext> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasCauseInContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Quantity> .
