<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasCauseInContext> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "来源支持的因果及比较命题：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“结果量描述”记录到“原因事件描述”的来源支持的因果及比较命题。034 保持 effect→cause 方向，015 保持比较级及多结果共同陈述；不自动拆分为每个独立因果，不将 more 当普通数量词。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasCauseInContext> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasCauseInContext> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:sourceSampleIds> "PILOT-034" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasComparativeClaim> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
