<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasComparativeClaim> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "记录来源对比较对象组给出的完整比较命题，保留共同作用域，不自动拆分因果。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasComparativeClaim> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasComparativeClaim> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:sourceSampleIds> "PILOT-015" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasDefiningExpression> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasDefiningExpression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Symbol> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasDefiningExpression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hasDefiningExpression"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasDefiningExpression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasDefiningExpression> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "符号的局部表达式定义：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“算子符号”记录到“表达式文本字面量”的符号的局部表达式定义。保留向量/算子排版证明与书页；字符串保存不意味着完整数学结构已建模。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasDefiningExpression> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasDefiningExpression> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:sourceSampleIds> "PILOT-011" .
