<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasEquationConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:FlowContext> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasEquationConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hasEquationConstraint"@en .
