<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasLoadCapacityDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:FluidGroup> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasLoadCapacityDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hasLoadCapacityDescription"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasLoadCapacityDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Capacity> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasLoadCapacityDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "受限定的承载能力：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“流体对象组”记录到“负载能力命题”的受限定的承载能力。保留 can 与 little or no、剪切和拉伸的组合；不自动变成完全无承载能力的否定。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasLoadCapacityDescription> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
