<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasNormativeNotationRequirement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "局部记号规范要求：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“记号惯例”记录到“要求命题”的局部记号规范要求。保留 would require 与作者忽略惯例的后文；δ 双划按原页保留，未知模态不改 asserted。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasNormativeNotationRequirement> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasNormativeNotationRequirement> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:sourceSampleIds> "PILOT-036" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasPremise> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasPremise> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Context> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasPremise> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hasPremise"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasPremise> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Premise> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasPremise> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "推导前提：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“推导情境”记录到“前提命题”的推导前提。有势质量力与定常且（正压或不可压缩）属于本段推导条件，保留 AND/OR 及沿流线范围。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasPremise> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasPremise> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:sourceSampleIds> "PILOT-027" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasScopedClassification> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasScopedClassification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Subject> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasScopedClassification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hasScopedClassification"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasScopedClassification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Classification> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasScopedClassification> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "带范围和条件的分类/判据：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“受限对象或对象组”记录到“模型或分类判据”的带范围和条件的分类/判据。区分 thermally perfect、Newtonian、simple 的分类体系；can、Many、all 和条件挂到命题，禁止生成无条件全称 subclass。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasScopedClassification> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasScopedClassification> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:sourceSampleIds> "PILOT-003,PILOT-039,PILOT-040" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasScopedEventDescription> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasScopedEventDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Subject> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasScopedEventDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hasScopedEventDescription"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasScopedEventDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Event> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasScopedEventDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "事件及其方式、尺度或倾向：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“参与对象”记录到“事件描述”的事件及其方式、尺度或倾向。burst/develop/bend 为事件，quickly 和 very small distance 是方式/尺度，tend to 是倾向；不同事件不通过共享关系被判同义。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasScopedEventDescription> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasScopedEventDescription> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:sourceSampleIds> "PILOT-021,PILOT-030,PILOT-031" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasStructuralAssumption> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasStructuralAssumption> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Context> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasStructuralAssumption> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hasStructuralAssumption"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasStructuralAssumption> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Assumption> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasStructuralAssumption> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "分析使用对象和局部结构假设：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“分析情境”记录到“带角色及数量的假设命题”的分析使用对象和局部结构假设。分析者与参考系场景区分；一入口且一出口的角色与 AND 保留，不能变成所有系统的结构。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasStructuralAssumption> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasStructuralAssumption> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:sourceSampleIds> "PILOT-017,PILOT-024" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasTermInterpretation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasTermInterpretation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Term> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasTermInterpretation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hasTermInterpretation"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasTermInterpretation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Interpretation> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasTermInterpretation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "方程项含义及方程未表达内容：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“有来源身份的方程项”记录到“解释命题”的方程项含义及方程未表达内容。精确绑定方程号/项；否定指定内容不是否定该物理量存在，material 不自行改写为累计质量。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasTermInterpretation> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasTermInterpretation> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:sourceSampleIds> "PILOT-020,PILOT-025" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasUnitExpression> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasUnitExpression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:UnitSpec> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasUnitExpression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hasUnitExpression"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasUnitExpression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasUnitExpression> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "量的单位/量纲文本：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“量的单位说明”记录到“单位文本字面量”的量的单位/量纲文本。单位说明不是测量值；保留文本、datatype 规范化待办，不凭量纲填入数值或换算。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasUnitExpression> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:hasUnitExpression> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:sourceSampleIds> "PILOT-007" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isDesignatedInContext> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isDesignatedInContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ControlBoundary> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isDesignatedInContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "isDesignatedInContext"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isDesignatedInContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ControlSurfaceRole> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isDesignatedInContext> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "对象的局部称谓/角色：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“控制体边界对象”记录到“控制面角色”的对象的局部称谓/角色。控制体端面被指定为控制面；命名或角色不等于物理因果，也不自动成为全体边界的分类。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isDesignatedInContext> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isDesignatedInContext> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:sourceSampleIds> "PILOT-010" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isIntroducedInPassage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isIntroducedInPassage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ConceptGroup> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isIntroducedInPassage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "isIntroducedInPassage"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isIntroducedInPassage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Passage> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isIntroducedInPassage> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "教材篇章介绍：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“教材概念组”记录到“来源篇章”的教材篇章介绍。work and energy 的组合范围及本书前文位置保留；学科不是施事，篇章位置不作物理时间。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isIntroducedInPassage> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isIntroducedInPassage> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:sourceSampleIds> "PILOT-002" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isResultOfDerivation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isResultOfDerivation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:DerivationResult> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isResultOfDerivation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "isResultOfDerivation"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isResultOfDerivation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Derivation> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isResultOfDerivation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "有输入和范围的推导/表达关系：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“方程或量”记录到“推导描述”的有输入和范围的推导/表达关系。推导节点分别记录输入、操作、输出、适用范围；不把一输入描述升级为唯一输入，不倒转结果与操作。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isResultOfDerivation> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isResultOfDerivation> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:sourceSampleIds> "PILOT-006,PILOT-026,PILOT-032" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isSpecifiedByPrinciple> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isSpecifiedByPrinciple> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:PropertyCount> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isSpecifiedByPrinciple> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "isSpecifiedByPrinciple"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isSpecifiedByPrinciple> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Principle> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isSpecifiedByPrinciple> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "原理对状态描述数目的约束：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“独立性质数目概念”记录到“状态公设概念”的原理对状态描述数目的约束。不把所给两性质的局部简单系统假设推广到所有物质，也不将公设当数值。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isSpecifiedByPrinciple> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:isSpecifiedByPrinciple> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:sourceSampleIds> "PILOT-022" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:participatesInFunctionalRelation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:participatesInFunctionalRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Variables> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:participatesInFunctionalRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "participatesInFunctionalRelation"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:participatesInFunctionalRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Function> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:participatesInFunctionalRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "变量函数关联和物质依赖：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“变量组”记录到“函数关系描述”的变量函数关联和物质依赖。保留 some 的变量集合与不同物质的依赖；函数关系不是因果边，不能省略多元角色。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:participatesInFunctionalRelation> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:participatesInFunctionalRelation> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:sourceSampleIds> "PILOT-013,PILOT-016" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:requiresAccountingFor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:requiresAccountingFor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Context> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:requiresAccountingFor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "requiresAccountingFor"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:requiresAccountingFor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Requirement> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:requiresAccountingFor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "局部分析的考虑要求：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“分析情境”记录到“能量考虑命题”的局部分析的考虑要求。保留 we 的局部主体、Because of this 的先行说明和 must；不建物理因果边。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:requiresAccountingFor> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:requiresAccountingFor> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:sourceSampleIds> "PILOT-008" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:statesProposition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:statesProposition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Law> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:statesProposition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "statesProposition"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:statesProposition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Claim> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:statesProposition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "定律的来源陈述：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“定律概念”记录到“来源命题”的定律的来源陈述。命题保留作者原文与范围；不凭常识补恒压/恒温等未提供条件，也不将原文简述提升为普遍物理定律新证明。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:statesProposition> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:statesProposition> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:sourceSampleIds> "PILOT-014,PILOT-033" .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:usesControlVolume> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:usesControlVolume> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Context> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:usesControlVolume> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "usesControlVolume"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:usesControlVolume> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:ControlVolume> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:usesControlVolume> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "分析使用对象和局部结构假设：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“分析情境”记录到“控制体对象”的分析使用对象和局部结构假设。分析者与参考系场景区分；一入口且一出口的角色与 AND 保留，不能变成所有系统的结构。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:usesControlVolume> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
