<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:variesWithSubstance> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:variesWithSubstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:Function> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:variesWithSubstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "variesWithSubstance"@en .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:variesWithSubstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:class:MaterialContext> .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:variesWithSubstance> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "变量函数关联和物质依赖：在有来源身份和限定范围的命题中，从“函数关系描述”记录到“物质条件”的变量函数关联和物质依赖。保留 some 的变量集合与不同物质的依赖；函数关系不是因果边，不能省略多元角色。 本关系的使用必须保留来源、限定信息和完整命题；建模定义不代表候选事实已获批准。"@zh .
<urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:property:variesWithSubstance> <urn:kg:shared-source-model:20261118:annotation:baseRelease> "release_b983ac2cbc54c6c14229aaf7658be6710980b7e8fe02fc621e8393238c9ba590" .
